{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はアイスクリームが大好きです!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN43XAZRA0Y8EPCNTGTG3ZF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nなので、おっきいのを食べに行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN43YK3TQAKR2D88SH8SGSC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n友達も同じものを頼みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスは上から、\n苺カフェオレバニラチョコグレープオレンジラムネ抹茶\nの層になっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苺が一番おいしかったな〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は、この大きさでいちごとバニラだけのを頼みたいです(*´▽`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今日ある本を手に入れました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんの本だか知りたいですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(๑¯﹀¯๑)ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳細はまた後日･･･。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}